    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138764211?u=fd6e1047bcae81137b81095986a8ab16ca3d8914&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Rust should have a spaceship operator <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;=&gt;</code> for cleaner three-way comparisons.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/bjoernager/rfcs/blob/spaceship-operator/text/3776-spaceship-operator.md\">Rendered</a>.<br>\n<sub><sub>please do not permanently label me as a bringer of bad ideas because of this</sub></sub></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/pull/3776",
            "title": "RFC: Add \"spaceship\" operator.",
            "date_modified": "2025-02-22T15:16:53.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-02-21T17:38:16.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "bjoernager",
                "url": "https://github.com/bjoernager"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5963049?u=2149075d53ee210932e16cd6a05632d9e9d2abaf&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This RFC guarantees the representation of <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;str</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;[T]</code> to be equivalent to a <code class=\"notranslate\">repr(C)</code> struct containing a pointer and a length.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cramertj/rfcs/blob/slice-repr/text/0000-guaranteed-slice-repr.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/pull/3775",
            "title": "Guarantee slice representation",
            "date_modified": "2025-02-20T19:31:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-02-19T00:12:13.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "cramertj",
                "url": "https://github.com/cramertj"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1178779?u=4bd8c56dac06b90d985b2688ec76f0859f297404&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This adds an RFC proposing a new attribute that would help detect mistakes when a parameter of a function is not used after the function returns. E.g. when inserting into a collection that is then immediately dropped.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/joshtriplett/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/joshtriplett\">@joshtriplett</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Kixunil/rust-rfcs/blob/must-use-output/text/3773-must-use-output.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/pull/3773",
            "title": "Add `must-use-output` attribute",
            "date_modified": "2025-02-16T19:26:44.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-02-16T12:10:15.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kixunil",
                "url": "https://github.com/Kixunil"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60961?u=967a9ccc3f7dba0d5d3acd694e3cf81893defe96&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Deprecate <code class=\"notranslate\">lib.edition</code>, etc in favor of only setting <code class=\"notranslate\">package.edition</code>, removing the fields in the next Edition.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/epage/rfcs/blob/build-target-edition/text/3772-build-target-edition.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
